# Files that `gcloud run deploy --source .` must not upload. With this file present, gcloud does not
# fall back to .gitignore, so the list has to be complete. The Dockerfile builds from source
# (package files, tsconfig.base.json, server, web), so build output is not needed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
data/raw/
.git
*.log
**/dist/
